# BuildKit reads `<dockerfile>.dockerignore` in preference to the context-root
# `.dockerignore`, which lets this stay next to the Dockerfile it belongs to
# even though the build context is the workspace root. Paths below are
# therefore relative to the WORKSPACE ROOT.

**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/.turbo
.git
.gitignore
*.log
.vscode
.idea
.claude

# the mobile app never enters the API image
apps/mobile
docs
postman
apps/api/test

# secrets
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# build plumbing that would invalidate cache for no reason
**/Dockerfile*
docker-compose*.yml
